<view class="page" style="{{themeStyle}}"><view class="intro"><text class="eyebrow">MY VISITS</text><view class="heading">每一次到店，都值得期待。</view><view class="muted">线上申请须经门店确认，请留意最新状态。</view></view><view class="error-bar" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}<button bindtap="load">点击重新登录 / 刷新</button></view><view class="empty" wx:if="{{!loading && !orders.length && !error}}">还没有预约申请。<button class="primary" bindtap="book">预约一段好时光 →</button></view><view wx:if="{{loading && !orders.length}}" class="empty">正在读取您的预约…</view>
  <view class="order" wx:for="{{orders}}" wx:key="id"><view class="order-top"><view class="status {{item.status}}">{{item.statusLabel}}</view><text class="tiny">{{item.id}}</text></view><view class="card-title">{{item.serviceName}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.storeName}}</view><view class="receipt-row"><text class="label">到店时间</text><text class="value">{{item.bookingDate}}　{{item.startTime}}</text></view><view class="receipt-row"><text class="label">同行人数</text><text class="value">{{item.headcount}}人</text></view><view class="receipt-row"><text class="label">调理师意向</text><text class="value">{{item.therapistIntentName}}</text></view><view class="receipt-row"><text class="label">接待调理师</text><text class="value">{{item.assignedTherapistName}}</text></view><view class="banner" wx:if="{{item.status==='PENDING'}}"><text class="strong">尚未预约成功，请等待人工确认</text>门店正在核对接待安排，请以门店回复及本页确认结果为准。意向调理师不代表已分配。</view><view class="banner good" wx:if="{{item.status==='CONFIRMED'}}"><text class="strong">门店已确认，请按约到店</text>如需调整，请提前操作或联系门店。具体调理师安排由门店统筹。</view><view class="banner" wx:if="{{item.status==='CANCELLED'}}">该预约已取消。{{item.cancelReason}}</view><view class="order-actions" wx:if="{{item.status==='PENDING' || item.status==='CONFIRMED'}}"><button data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="edit">申请改约</button><button data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="cancel">取消申请</button><button data-store="{{item.storeId}}" bindtap="call">电话联系</button><customer-service variant="order" store-id="{{item.storeId}}"/></view><view class="edit-panel" wx:if="{{editing===item.id}}"><view class="field"><text class="label">新的到店日期</text><picker mode="date" value="{{date}}" start="{{today}}" end="{{lastDay}}" bindchange="date"><view class="picker">{{date}}</view></picker></view><view class="field"><text class="label">新的开始时间</text><picker range="{{times}}" value="{{timeIndex}}" bindchange="time"><view class="picker">{{times[timeIndex] || '无可用时段'}}</view></picker></view><view class="tiny">改约后将恢复为“待门店确认”。临近到店不能自助处理时，请联系门店。</view><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || !times.length}}" bindtap="save">提交改约申请</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="close">暂不修改</button></view></view>
  <view class="section"><button class="secondary" wx:if="{{runtime.customerTemplateId}}" bindtap="notify">订阅预约结果和到店提醒（自愿）</button><customer-service label="微信客服 · 预约咨询"/><view class="tiny" style="margin-top:20rpx">预约数据仅向当前微信身份展示，不会仅凭填写的联系电话开放他人的预约记录。页面展示最近100笔申请。</view></view>
</view>
